      "end_to_end_conversion": "1.8% — of 1,000 pairs who get excited about a business idea together, roughly 18 end up with a thriving partnership at year 3. 65% of startups fail due to co-founder conflict (Wasserman, Harvard). The #1 killer is unequal effort + 50/50 equity.",
